{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🤖 Monitoring AI Agents — Threat Hunting & Telemetry (Microsoft Sentinel)\r\n\r\nUnified visibility over your **agentic AI estate** — Microsoft 365 Copilot, Copilot Studio agents, Azure AI Foundry agents, and the OpenAI connector — from one workbook. Each tab reads the *real runtime telemetry* those platforms export to the Sentinel workspace and surfaces the same signals the detection packs alert on.\r\n\r\n## What this workbook covers (by tab)\r\n| Tab | Source | Tables & keys |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 📊 **Overview** | All sources | Cross-source volume, active-source status, activity trend |\r\n| 🟦 **M365 Copilot** | Microsoft Copilot connector | `CopilotActivity` · `RecordType`, `LLMEventData` (Messages[].JailbreakDetected, AccessedResources[].XPIADetected, RagSources) |\r\n| 🟨 **Copilot Studio** | Agent App Insights | `AppEvents` (BotMessageReceived/Send, `Properties.text/conversationId/channelId`) + `AppDependencies` (DependencyType=Connector, `Target`, `Success`, `DurationMs`) |\r\n| 🟪 **Foundry Agents** | Foundry → App Insights | `AppDependencies` spans · `Properties['gen_ai.*']` (agent.name, conversation.id, tool.name/type, usage.*, request.model) + `microsoft.foundry.content_filter.results` |\r\n| 🟩 **OpenAI Connector** | OpenAI CCF | `ASimAgentEventLogs` / `OpenAIChatCompletions` (ModelName, InputTokensUsed, OutputTokensUsed, ToolName, AdditionalFields.input_user) + `OpenAIAuditLogs` |\r\n| 🔬 **Advanced Hunting** | Defender XDR | `BehaviorInfo` (Prompt Shield / AI-agent behaviors), `BehaviorEntities`, `AgentsInfo` (agent inventory, MCP, model, channels) — runnable directly in Advanced hunting |\r\n| 🗄️ **Data Lake** | Agent Observability (lake) | `UnifiedAgentObservability` (AISpanOutput spans, Src/Target agents), `EntraAgentIdentities` / `Blueprints` / `BlueprintPrincipals` / `AgentUsers` — usage-based billing |\r\n\r\n## Persona pages (aggregate across all sources)\r\n| Tab | Purpose |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 🧭 **Executive Overview** | 15 unified KPIs + AI Risk Score + requests by platform / business unit + top identities |\r\n| 📒 **Agent Inventory** | every agent (type, auth, knowledge, tools, MCP, owners) + ownerless / inactive / growth |\r\n| 📈 **Usage Analytics** | requests by day / model / user / department + averages (tokens, latency, cost) |\r\n| ⏱️ **Activity Timeline** | one chronological cross-source event feed |\r\n| 🚨 **Security Monitoring** | detection categories + alerts + severity + MITRE |\r\n| 🛡️ **Content Safety** | harm categories, jailbreak / Prompt Shield, trend, worst agents / models |\r\n| 🧠 **Model Observability** | per-model tokens / latency / cost / failures |\r\n| ⚙️ **Agent Operations** | failures, result codes, success %, exceptions |\r\n| 📋 **Governance** | ownerless / weak-auth / external-data / shadow-AI |\r\n| 🔎 **Investigation** | entity-pivot timeline + related alerts + sign-ins |\r\n| 🎯 **AI Risk Score** | weighted composite 0-100 + component sub-scores |\r\n\r\n## Persona pages (aggregate across all sources)\r\n| Tab | Purpose |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 🧭 **Executive Overview** | 15 unified KPIs + AI Risk Score + requests by platform / business unit + top identities |\r\n| 📒 **Agent Inventory** | every agent (type, auth, knowledge, tools, MCP, owners) + ownerless / inactive / growth |\r\n| 📈 **Usage Analytics** | requests by day / model / user / department + averages (tokens, latency, cost) |\r\n| ⏱️ **Activity Timeline** | one chronological cross-source event feed |\r\n| 🚨 **Security Monitoring** | detection categories + alerts + severity + MITRE |\r\n| 🛡️ **Content Safety** | harm categories, jailbreak / Prompt Shield, trend, worst agents / models |\r\n| 🧠 **Model Observability** | per-model tokens / latency / cost / failures |\r\n| ⚙️ **Agent Operations** | failures, result codes, success %, exceptions |\r\n| 📋 **Governance** | ownerless / weak-auth / external-data / shadow-AI |\r\n| 🔎 **Investigation** | entity-pivot timeline + related alerts + sign-ins |\r\n| 🎯 **AI Risk Score** | weighted composite 0-100 + component sub-scores |\r\n| 📡 **Telemetry Health** | All sources | Per-table volume/cost, `AppDependencies` gen_ai-vs-other split, content-recording coverage, `CopilotActivity` RecordType tiering |\r\n| 🛡️ **Detections & Coverage** | All sources | Detection-pack reference + firing `SecurityAlert` / `SecurityIncident` |\r\n\r\n## Filters\r\n**Workspace** (portable) · **Time range** (applies to every tile) · **Agent / bot / model / actor contains** (free-text filter on the per-source grids).\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites (per source — tiles stay empty until met)\r\n- **M365 Copilot** → Microsoft Copilot data connector populating `CopilotActivity`; set the table plan to **Analytics** for rules.\r\n- **Copilot Studio** → agent's **workspace-based** Application Insights pointed at this workspace (Settings → Advanced → Application Insights); enable **Log sensitive properties** for the `Properties.text` (content) tiles.\r\n- **Foundry** → project connected to workspace-based App Insights so spans land in `AppDependencies`; set `AZURE_TRACING_GEN_AI_CONTENT_RECORDING_ENABLED=true` for the text-content tiles (not retroactive).\r\n- **OpenAI** → OpenAI codeless connector + parsers so `ASimAgentEventLogs` / `OpenAIAuditLogs` resolve; callers should set the `user` request param for per-user tiles.\r\n\r\nEvery query uses `union isfuzzy=true`, so a tab for a source you haven't onboarded renders empty instead of erroring."
      },
      "name": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "p-ws",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workspace",
            "label": "Workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::1"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-timerange",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 172800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "p-agentsearch",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AgentSearch",
            "label": "Agent / bot / model / actor contains",
            "description": "Free-text filter applied to the per-source grids (agent name, bot UserId, model, actor). Empty = show all.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-dept",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DepartmentSearch",
            "label": "Department contains",
            "description": "Filters usage / business-unit tiles by resolved department (IdentityInfo join on actor UPN).",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-pin",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "PriceInput",
            "label": "Price / 1K input tokens (USD)",
            "description": "Used for token cost estimation tiles.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "0.005"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-pout",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "PriceOutput",
            "label": "Price / 1K output tokens (USD)",
            "description": "Used for token cost estimation tiles.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "0.015"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-tab",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "selectedTab",
            "label": "selectedTab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "exec",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "Pick a **Workspace** and **Time range** above, then use the tabs. Type in **Agent / bot / model / actor contains** to focus the grids on one agent. Content-based tiles (prompt/response text) require the per-source content-recording setting noted in the Prerequisites above."
      },
      "name": "FiltersHelp"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "t-exec",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🧭 Executive Overview",
            "subTarget": "exec",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-cp",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🟦 M365 Copilot",
            "subTarget": "copilot",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
